, so the regions were briefly on different versions. I retried once and it finished.\n- All three regions now run v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's only one incident and one page went out.\n- The incident describes the failure, the rollback and the orchestrator error. It lists three follow-ups:\n  - Find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error.\n  - Review why v2.3.1 was released to production when its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy in staging.", "type": "text"}]}]}